*
*  Run an optimization of the PM7 parameters for intermolecular interactions
*  
*
*     Keywords used
*
* SET:        Define a file that contains a list of compounds to be used.
* REF:        Define one or more folders that contain reference data for systems defined by SET.  
*
dep PM6-D3H4 &
external="../CHNOXSP/CHNOXSP.rp"; &
"../Elements/Group IA.rp"; &
"../Elements/Group IIA.rp"; &
"../Elements/Group IIIA.rp"; &
"../Elements/Si.rp"; &
"../Elements/Bi.rp"
